#. Short description.
#, gp-priority: high
msgid ""
"Do you play Singles or Doubles Tournaments? This plugin manages Rotation "
"Tournaments where players have a different partner in each game."
msgstr "您在進行單打或雙打比賽嗎？此外掛可管理輪換賽，選手在每場比賽中都有新搭檔。"

#. Plugin name.
#, gp-priority: high
msgid "Rotation Tournaments"
msgstr "輪換賽"

#. Found in installation paragraph.
msgid ""
"After installation, go to the app's settings and enter the address of your "
"website where this plugin is installed."
msgstr "安裝後，開啟應用程式設定並輸入安裝此外掛的網站地址。"

#. Found in installation paragraph.
msgid ""
"Or download it directly from this link: "
"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=cz.doroto.app"
msgstr ""
"或直接透過此連結下載：https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=cz.doroto.app"

#. Found in installation paragraph.
msgid "Search for \"Rotation Tournaments\" on the Google Play Store."
msgstr "在 Google Play 中搜尋「Rotation Tournaments」。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid ""
"To get the full experience of managing tournaments on the go, download our "
"mobile app, now available on Google Play!"
msgstr "要隨時隨地全面管理賽事，請下載我們的行動應用程式，現已在 Google Play 上架！"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "<strong>YouTube quick intro:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>YouTube 簡介：</strong>"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "Video for a quick introduction to the Rotation Tournament:"
msgstr "輪換賽簡介影片："

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid ""
"Yes. If you install the Rotation Tournaments plugin, allow player "
"registration, and enable visibility in the website list, your site can "
"appear in the Android app. Initially, someone must manually enter your "
"website address into the app. After that, it becomes visible in the list for"
" all users."
msgstr ""
"可以。如果您安裝 Rotation Tournaments 外掛、允許選手註冊並在網站列表中開啟可見性，您的網站就可能出現在 Android "
"應用程式中。首先需要有人在應用程式中手動輸入您的網站地址。之後，該網站將在列表中對所有使用者可見。"

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid ""
"Yes. An iOS version of the Rotation Tournaments app is planned and will be "
"released in the near future."
msgstr "會的。Rotation Tournaments 應用程式的 iOS 版本已在計劃中，即將釋出。"

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "Will my website be visible in the Rotation Tournaments Android app?"
msgstr "我的網站會顯示在 Android 版 Rotation Tournaments 應用程式中嗎？"

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "Will there be an iPhone or iPad version of the app?"
msgstr "會有 iPhone 或 iPad 版的應用程式嗎？"

#. Found in installation paragraph.
msgid "<strong>How to install Wordpress plugin:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>如何安裝 WordPress 外掛：</strong>"

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid ""
"After activating the plugin, 4 pages will be created: one for managing "
"tournaments (main page), one with tournament rules, and additional pages for"
" Privacy Policy and Terms of Service. A sample post announcing a newly "
"created tournament will also be added."
msgstr "啟用外掛後將建立 4 個頁面：一個用於管理賽事（主頁面），一個用於賽事規則，以及隱私政策和服務條款頁面。還會新增一篇宣佈新賽事的示例文章。"

#. Found in installation paragraph.
msgid "<strong>How to install the Android app:</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>如何安裝 Android 應用程式：</strong>"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid ""
"<strong>This plugin is the server-side for the \"Rotation Tournaments\" "
"Android app.</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>此外掛是 Android 應用程式「Rotation Tournaments」的伺服器端。</strong>"

#. Screenshot description.
msgid ""
"Individual tournament participants enter their results into the WordPress "
"server and share the data with each other."
msgstr "賽事參與者將結果錄入 WordPress 伺服器，並相互共享資料。"

