msgstr "修復——固定連結結構在使用懸浮幫助圖示時也能工作。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - Tournament name is not copied from previous one."
msgstr "修復——賽事名稱不再從上一個賽事複製。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Add - More tournament examples for demonstration."
msgstr "新增——更多用於演示的示例賽事。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Add - Floating help icon."
msgstr "新增——懸浮幫助圖示。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Add - Prevent cashing for logged users."
msgstr "新增——為已登入使用者關閉快取。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - Doubles Badminton table also for co-players"
msgstr "修復——羽毛球雙打表格也適用於搭檔"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Add - Tournament progress info."
msgstr "新增——賽事進度資訊。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - Change game results availability."
msgstr "修復——更改比賽結果的可訪問性。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Add - Special group count."
msgstr "新增——特殊組成員人數。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Change of information about the end of the tournament round."
msgstr "更改賽事輪次結束的資訊。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - Opponent selection."
msgstr "修復——對手選擇。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Add - Pair selection mechanism explanation on the help page."
msgstr "新增——在幫助頁面說明組合選擇機制。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Fix - Pair selection didn´t take into account number of played games in "
"total."
msgstr "修復——組合選擇未考慮已進行比賽的總場數。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - Rights to Suspension and Resumption."
msgstr "修復——暫停和恢復的許可權。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - Rights to add a special group."
msgstr "修復——加入特殊組的許可權。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - Rights to add a tournament admin."
msgstr "修復——新增賽事管理員的許可權。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - Rights to add other players into tournaments."
msgstr "修復——向賽事新增其他選手的許可權。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - Do not show instructions during the tournament presentation."
msgstr "修復——賽事演示期間不顯示說明。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Add - Admin can change a default value for minimum number of games played "
"before a player can be declared a winner."
msgstr "新增——管理員可以更改選手被宣佈為冠軍所需最少比賽場數的預設值。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Add - The ability to specify a minimum number of games played before a "
"player can be declared a winner."
msgstr "新增——可設定選手被宣佈為冠軍所需的最少比賽場數。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - Removing a player from a tournament."
msgstr "修復——從賽事中移除選手。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - Ready for testing in WP Playground."
msgstr "修復——可在 WP Playground 中測試。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - Solving some database errors with empty values."
msgstr "修復——消除了一些與空值有關的資料庫錯誤。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - Update for WP Playground."
msgstr "修復——針對 WP Playground 的更新。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - Improved playmate choose."
msgstr "修復——改進了搭檔選擇。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - Problems with removing players during a game."
msgstr "修復——比賽中移除選手的問題。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - A currently playing player can´t be removed."
msgstr "修復——正在比賽的選手不能被移除。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - Fix real count of players after their removing."
msgstr "修復——移除選手後選手人數正確。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - Fix an error during removing a player from the tournament."
msgstr "修復——從賽事中移除選手時的錯誤。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - Redirection to a tournament in case of a user entry."
msgstr "修復——使用者錄入資料時跳轉到賽事。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fix - icon format."
msgstr "修復——圖示格式。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Modification for WP Playground."
msgstr "針對 WP Playground 的完善。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Fix - Fixed a bug in the database that prevented a tournament record from "
"being created on some servers."
msgstr "修復——修正了導致某些伺服器上無法建立賽事記錄的資料庫錯誤。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Fix - Unregistered users can no longer enter results in the singles "
"tournament."
msgstr "修復——未註冊使用者不再能在單打賽事中錄入結果。"

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Possibility to remove players from an already ongoing tournament."
msgstr "可以從已在進行的賽事中移除選手。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"New - Expanded the ability for tournament administrators to browse through "
"players they have already met at the tournament."
msgstr "新功能——賽事管理員可以看到更多已在賽事中遇到過的選手。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"New - If the player has not yet registered for any tournament, it is "
"possible to choose whether to show him a quick help."
msgstr "新功能——如果選手尚未報名任何賽事，可以選擇是否向其顯示簡短幫助。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "New - Optional login prompt."
msgstr "新功能——可選的登入邀請。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Fix - If all tournaments were deleted, a new tournament could not be "
"created."
msgstr "修復——刪除所有賽事後無法建立新賽事。"

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Trial tournament improvements.\n"
"Added the option to announce the end of the tournament round."
msgstr ""
"改進了練習賽事。\n"
"新增公佈賽事輪次結束的功能。"

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Improved the visual appearance of the main page.\n"
"Badminton added to the list of available tournaments."
msgstr ""
"改進了主頁面外觀。\n"
"將羽毛球加入可用賽事列表。"

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Option to announce separate winners from the special group and outside the "
"special group."
msgstr "可以分別公佈特殊組內外的冠軍。"

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Notices after a plugin activation.\n"
"Added player trend."
msgstr ""
"啟用外掛後的通知。\n"
"新增選手趨勢。"

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Modified tournament editing tab.\n"
"Added option to change tournament type."
msgstr ""
"更改了賽事編輯標籤。\n"
"新增更改賽事型別的功能。"

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Reactivating the plugin doesn´t affect the already deleted tournament example. \n"
"Unblock offering maximum games count.\n"
"Fix tournament change when entering results.\n"
"Added quick help for newcomers.\n"
"Allow the final match also for singles."
msgstr ""
"重新啟用外掛不會影響已刪除的示例賽事。\n"
"開放了最大局數的選擇。\n"
"修正了錄入結果時賽事被更改的問題。\n"
"為新手新增了簡短幫助。\n"
"單打也允許進行決賽。"

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Added the option for single tournaments. \n"
"Created an environment for additional sports."
msgstr ""
"新增單打賽事功能。\n"
"為其他運動建立了環境。"

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"The administrator can now use 'hide' option when editing the match result.\n"
"Free score input is allowed. This opens using not only for tennis but for example for table tennis or beach volleyball."
msgstr ""
"管理員現在可以在更改比賽結果時使用「隱藏」選項。\n"
"允許自由錄入比分。這樣外掛不僅可用於網球，也可用於乒乓球或沙灘排球等。"

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Minor changes in code:\n"
"* Allow to transfer organizer rights to a non-playing user.\n"
"* Ensuring an even rotation of serves at the start of the tournament."
msgstr ""
"程式碼的小改動：\n"
"* 允許將組織者許可權轉讓給不參賽的使用者。\n"
"* 確保賽事開始時發球均衡交替。"

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fixed choosing between left and right side in first matches."
msgstr "修正了首輪比賽中左右側的選擇。"

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "A small modification of admin screen."
msgstr "管理介面的小改動。"

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "First release to public."
msgstr "首個公開版本。"
